The '''Mithril Deposits''' are a randomly-generated location in the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}. Farmland is used as the ground, and minecart tracks are often found running along the pathways. The {{Zone|Mines of Divan}} spawns in a random location inside, as well as some [[Crystal_Hollows/Special_Locations#Mithril_Deposits|other structures]]. 

{{ZoneText|A familiar-looking place rich with Jade Gemstones.}}

